ases or other Office files.\n- word-documents: Use when creating or revising a Word file while preserving its document structure. Not for plain-text drafting or PDF editing.\n- loop: Run a prompt or slash command repeatedly (for example /loop 10m /health); with no interval given, the model paces itself between ticks. - Use when work should re-run on a cadence: polling a build, watching a queue, periodic upkeep. A single future r…\n- schedule: Create, update, list, or run scheduled local agents (routines) that execute on a cron schedule via the daemon - Use when the user wants a recurring agent, automated background tasks, a cron job for the harness, or management of existing scheduled ag…\n- deep-research: Multi-source research with adversarial fact-checking — angle fan-out, source extraction, majority-vote verification, cited synthesis. - For research that needs many sources and real fact-checking. Scale with honesty: full depth runs roughly 25-40 ag…\n</system-reminder>"
